# --- PRESETS ---

### Create Preset
POST http://ec2-3-111-171-0.ap-south-1.compute.amazonaws.com:8080/api/v1/presets HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Thumbnail",
  "width": 480,
  "height": 320,
  "format": "webp",
  "quality": 60
}

### List Presets
GET http://ec2-3-111-171-0.ap-south-1.compute.amazonaws.com:8080/api/v1/presets HTTP/1.1



# --- ASSETS ---

### Create Asset
POST http://ec2-3-111-171-0.ap-south-1.compute.amazonaws.com:8080/api/v1/assets HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filename": "1741694841740893.jpg",
  "fileSizeBytes": 32456,
  "contentType": "image/jpeg"
}

### Get Asset
GET http://ec2-3-111-171-0.ap-south-1.compute.amazonaws.com:8080/api/v1/assets/b03e6f45-ced3-4da8-88b2-af83c5090227 HTTP/1.1